# Every text file gets LF in the working tree, also on Windows with core.autocrlf=true.
# PHP, SQL, shell scripts and the language files end up in Linux containers (Dolibarr in the test
# stack, the release ZIP); a trailing \r breaks shell scripts there and pollutes PHP output.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.php text eol=lf
*.sql text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.lang text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
